# Vendored, build-generated Ghostty resource tree, shipped byte-for-byte
# via the GhosttyKitResources target's Bundle.module. Mark the whole
# subtree binary (-text) so git applies NO text/EOL/encoding
# normalization: that would corrupt the compiled terminfo entries and
# desync the committed bytes from what build-xcframework.sh produces,
# firing release.sh's resources gate spuriously forever. The tree is
# build-generated and never hand-edited, so losing per-line diffs on
# the theme/shell-integration text files is an acceptable trade.
Sources/GhosttyKitResources/Resources/** -text
